gb-008-title = a mutation needs --yes when there is no terminal
gb-008-what = deploy, release, rollback and fastlane change state; without a terminal to confirm on, they refuse unless --yes is passed (contract C10).
gb-008-cause-1 = run from a script, CI or a pipe
gb-009-title = not a current main checkout
gb-009-what = releases and deploys run from the invoking checkout, and only a main checkout kept current with origin carries the pin that was merged. A branch or detached checkout can deploy a stale pin and verify green.
