gb-077-title = this checkout's origin is not where release candidates are cut
gb-077-what = the repository that origin names does not run rc-validate.yml, so a tag pushed there is never validated or built where the ladder reads images; the run refuses before the tag (ADR 1173).
gb-077-cause-1 = the checkout is a clone of a mirror or a fork, not the primary repository
gb-078-title = no release signer is known, so the update refuses
gb-078-what = `goatbuilder update` checks SHA256SUMS against the repository whose release workflow signed it. It found none: the working directory is in no checkout whose ops/goatbuilder/goatbuilder.yaml names repo.release_source or repo.source, and this binary was built outside a release workflow, so it names no publisher itself. Nothing was installed.
gb-078-cause-1 = goatbuilder update ran outside a deployment checkout with a locally built binary
gb-012-title = the candidate's image build did not succeed
gb-012-what = after the tag was pushed, the image workflow did not appear, or ran and failed, so there is no image to validate.
gb-012-cause-1 = the workflow is not triggered by this tag shape
gb-012-cause-2 = a build failure on the tagged commit
gb-013-title = the image is not in the registry
gb-013-what = the tag's image was not found under repo.image_namespace, so no digest can be pinned.
gb-013-cause-1 = crane is missing or unauthenticated — rc.sh resolves the digest with crane and discards its error, so a missing crane reads as the image not existing
gb-013-cause-2 = the build published under another name
gb-013-cause-3 = the package is private and the token cannot read it
gb-014-title = a live validation row failed
gb-014-what = the candidate deployed and a live row on the goatnet failed. On dev the candidate is dead; on preprod after a dev pass it stays open for investigation.
gb-014-cause-1 = a row exited 2 — it was never run: its toolchain is missing on this laptop (Playwright for the intake rows, a goat context for the invite rows); the candidate is untested, not dead
gb-014-cause-2 = a real regression in the candidate
gb-014-cause-3 = the row's runner settings are stale for this goatnet
gb-015-title = the checkout could not fast-forward after the pin landed
gb-015-what = the pin PR merged, and the local main has diverged from origin/main, so the deploy could not proceed from a current tree. The PR is in; re-running resumes.
gb-015-cause-1 = local commits on main
gb-016-title = no runner settings for the goatnet
gb-016-what = ops/validation/goatnet-runners.yaml has no entry for the goatnet the live rows should run on.
gb-016-cause-1 = a new goatnet without its runner row
gb-017-title = not converged on every host
gb-017-what = the play ran, and at least one host's ledger does not name the declared digest with action=deploy. Done is read from the ledger, never assumed.
gb-017-cause-1 = the play failed part-way on that host
gb-017-cause-2 = the host is single-homed on another router role and was skipped by design (ADR 1084)
gb-017-cause-3 = the host was unreachable
gb-018-title = a required flag is missing or wrong
gb-018-what = release needs --ack and --version or --tag; --from takes tag|dev|rows|preprod|prod; --from prod needs --tag.
gb-018-cause-1 = the command was typed from memory
gb-019-title = the goatnet's CA key is not on this machine
gb-019-what = re-signing the intents needs <deploy.state_dir>/<goatnet>/ca.key.age and it is not there.
gb-019-cause-1 = this laptop never held that goatnet's CA key
gb-020-title = graduate.py did not produce the expected record
gb-020-what = graduation ran, and wrote no record, or the record names a different candidate_ref than the tag resolves to.
gb-020-cause-1 = an open graduation set blocking the move (ADR 1125)
gb-020-cause-2 = a candidate record edited by hand
gb-021-title = fastlane refused
gb-021-what = fastlane is the deliberate exception to the ladder and refuses an unpinned digest, an open graduation set, or an artifact whose rollback is not a pin revert.
gb-021-cause-1 = the ref has no digest under repo.image_namespace
gb-021-cause-2 = a graduation set is open for the component
gb-022-title = intent-sign failed
gb-022-what = re-signing a goatnet's intents after a pin move failed; the signed index is unchanged.
